Feature: slice-5 / org-admin-billing-readonly
Branch: feat/web-app-slice-5
Verified: 2026-05-28
Anchored to: docs/18 §8.4 "Billing — org's subscription, plan tier,
current period usage, pending reservations (read-only of
Subscription proto via clinical-svc.GetMyBillingState)"

What was built
==============
Zero code changes. The existing iOS screen
`flutter-app/superwizor/lib/screens/subscription_plan_screen.dart`
already satisfies the feature requirement:

- Read-only view of tier / cycle / sessions-left + pending
  reservations.
- Data source: `billingQuotaProvider` →
  `clinical-svc.GetMyBillingState` (proxy to
  `billing-svc.GetSubscription`). Confirmed in
  `lib/services/billing_quota_state.dart:6` +
  `lib/providers/billing_quota_provider.dart:6` — captured at
  evidence/.../wiring.log.
- No plan-change buttons — read-only by design (ORG_ADMINs change
  plans by contacting support; the Superwizor admin console has the
  AdminChangePlan path via Slice 4 features 5 + 8 once those land).
- No dart:io / Platform.* / File() — confirmed by `grep` over the
  file. Pure Material widgets + Riverpod + l10n.

Why this feature didn't need code
==================================
The screen was built in Phase B of the billing refactor (commit
0a25ac7 era) for the iOS app. Because we deliberately:
  - read via `clinical-svc.GetMyBillingState` instead of querying
    PG directly,
  - use Firestore-mirror cache for offline robustness (web SDK
    supports this),
  - and route the gRPC call through
    `GrpcOrGrpcWebClientChannel` which auto-selects gRPC-Web on
    browsers,
the iOS screen Just Works on Flutter Web. The "org-admin"
distinction in docs/18 §8.4 refers to *who navigates here*, not
to a separate screen — both ORG_ADMINs and THERAPISTs see the
same read-only view, scoped server-side by `caller's org`.

The dedicated org-admin entry point (a /admin tab in the
Flutter Web app routing the user to this screen) lands in
feature 7 (org-admin-org-settings) since that's where the
org-admin section's navigation gets built. For now ORG_ADMINs
reach the screen through the existing menu_screen.dart
Settings → Subscription path.

