3. Wiring inspection:
     services/billing_quota_state.dart line 6:
       "clinical-svc.GetMyBillingState (which proxies billing-
        svc.GetSubscription)"
     providers/billing_quota_provider.dart line 6:
       "clinical-svc.GetMyBillingState (proxy to billing-svc.
        GetSubscription)"
   Both lines pre-date Slice 5 — already wired correctly.
4. Code audit on subscription_plan_screen.dart for platform-
   specific imports: none found.

What's NOT in this feature (deferred)
======================================
- Dedicated /admin/billing route within the Flutter Web app's
  org-admin section — feature 7 builds the org-admin section
  navigation; this screen will be one of its tabs.
- Live screenshot of the screen with seeded data — same
  authentication constraint that hit every backend-dependent
  feature in Slices 3 + 4. Slice 6 Playwright happy-path E2E
  + a Firebase emulator with seeded billing data would surface
  the full visual.

